<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Welcome to LeaseManager</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: #2563eb; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; background: #f9fafb; }
        .welcome-box { background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 10px 0; text-align: center; }
        .login-btn { display: inline-block; background: #059669; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin: 10px 0; }
        .temp-password { background: #fef3c7; border: 1px solid #fbbf24; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 10px 0; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 12px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>👋 Welcome to LeaseManager!</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="welcome-box">
                <h2>Welcome, {{firstName}} {{lastName}}!</h2>
                <p>We're excited to have you as part of our platform.</p>
                <p><strong>Your Role:</strong> {{role}}</p>
            </div>
            
            {{#if hasPassword}}
                <div class="temp-password">
                    <h3>🔐 Your Temporary Password</h3>
                    <p><strong>Password:</strong> <code>{{tempPassword}}</code></p>
                    <p><strong>Important:</strong> Please change your password after your first login for security.</p>
                </div>
            {{/if}}
            
            <h3>Getting Started</h3>
            <p>You can now access your account and start using our lease management platform:</p>
            
            <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="login-btn">Log In to Your Account</a>
            
            <h3>What's Next?</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Complete your profile information</li>
                <li>Explore your dashboard</li>
                <li>Familiarize yourself with available features</li>
                <li>Contact support if you need assistance</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p>If you have any questions or need help getting started, our support team is here to assist you.</p>
            
            <p>We look forward to helping you manage your lease operations efficiently!</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
